    {
      "fileName": "scarlet-strands.json",
      "id": "n4JiVs3f72XS99f6",
      "name": "Scarlet Strands",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "n4JiVs3f72XS99f6",
        "folder": "AVQ4YLK6AJ4bUpKm",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Scarlet Strands",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>The innate magic in your blood turns your signature crimson tresses into more than just a stylish coiffure. If you pluck three strands of your bright red hair and spend 1 minute braiding them together, they magically transform into a strong, 50-foot, crimson rope. This rope can hold 1,000 pounds—great for lashing down sails in a storm, rappelling down a cliff to a hidden treasure, or tying up a Minkaian criminal with a sizable bounty on her head. You can have only one hair rope in existence at a time; if you braid a second, your first rope unravels back into three hairs.</p>\n<p>Your hairs can also form a net to catch fish or foes. Once per day, you can cast 4th-rank @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Web] as an innate primal spell, which takes the form of a crimson fishing net. You must have a hand free to pluck a few strands of your hair that you throw as part of the spell. The hairs regrow when the spell ends.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 9
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "kijimuna gnome heritage"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
